  "processed_at": "2026-08-27T02:26:40.888846+00:00",
  "title": "Competitive Procedure with Negotiation | Procurement Journey",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.procurementjourney.scot/competitive-procedure-negotiation",
  "description": null,
  "publication_date": null,
  "updated_date": null,
  "source_metadata": {
    "html_lang": "en"
  },
  "logical_structure": [],
  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The stages of this procedure are:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The first stage is advertisement and initial selection.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should publish beforehand:",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the scope of the contract including the minimum requirements,",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "award criteria and their weightings,",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The above should not be changed during the negotiation process.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Following the selection stage, you need to conduct an initial tender.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "You can then choose to award the contract on the basis of this initial tender, if this option was made clear in the notice/ITT. Otherwise you can choose one or more stages of negotiation prior to seeking final tenders.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "You negotiate tenders with the bidders, except for the final tender.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Accept final tender: at the end of this process you should ensure that the contract is awarded to the tender that best meets the award criteria.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Organisations may conduct the procedure in successive stages to reduce the number of bidders to be negotiated if indicated in the Procurement Documents.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There may be multiple stages of dialogue subsequent to a submission stage.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The negotiation dialogue held should only improve the bids, and not be on the minimum requirements and award criteria . The whole process should be fully documented.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The minimum number of bidders to shortlist for the initial tender is 3, if there are 3 that meet your selection requirements.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
